# The ClaimPulse backend the app calls. Copy this file to mobile/.env (git-ignored), then restart `npm start`.
# Leave it unset to keep the app fully local: the synthetic sample, manual entry and the phone's own voice.
#   Web, or the iOS simulator, on the same computer:  http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   Android emulator on the same computer:            http://10.0.2.2:8000
#   A phone on the same Wi-Fi:                        http://<the computer's IPv4 address, from ipconfig>:8000
#     For a phone, start the backend with `cd backend && uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`, and see
#     "From a phone" in docs/API_CONTRACTS.md (Wi-Fi set to Private, firewall rule).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
